lane/veil-21-2026-11-20 d5323b8b8): scripts/ops/migrationRehearsalCore.mjs (repo head 213; the
wave 'function-grants-default-deny', documented-manual-reversal by its own @rollback),
tests/ops/migrationRehearsal.test.js (head 213, 92 pending from 121, the wave rows, the
boundaries string, the snapshot counts, an assertion block for the wave), ARCHITECTURE.md
(migrations 213), docs/CURRENT_STATE.md (contiguous to 213; 10 ahead of production's 203),
docs/DEPLOY.md (head file 213 and its paragraph), and the veil's own head pin in
tests/security/galleryVeilSignalCopies.pglite.test.js ('the chain applies whole': the last file is 213's) and its rollback arm in
tests/security/galleryVeilCures.pglite.test.js ("001..212 then 212's down" built as buildDb(212), not every
file on disk, which now ends at 213).

Proven on the local composition (veil-21's tip + 213's commit + this one): tests/docs,
tests/ops, migrationSequenceAll, migrationOrdering, the walker and the manifest test, 300 of
300; tests/security whole 2015 of 2017 with the two veil pins red, then both files 37 of 37 after them; check-migration-head: 213 files, contiguous.

